OL,3,A'Steering casualty' preceded New
OL,4,AOrleans cruise ship collision, says
OL,5,ANTSB
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe NTSB said there are many different
OL,8,Fthings that could be classified as a
OL,9,Fsteering casualty, and they are
OL,10,F"looking at all of them".
